<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f7fb; padding: 20px; }
        .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; color: #fff; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        .content { color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; margin-top: 20px; background: #667eea; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; }
        .warning { background: #f8d7da; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #721c24; }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #777777; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= fullName %></strong>,</p>

        <p>We received a request to reset your Event Platform password. Click the button below to set a new password:</p>

        <p style="text-align:center;">
            <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
        </p>

        <div class="warning">
            This link will expire in <strong><%= expiresIn %></strong>. If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.
        </div>

        <p>The HackByteCodex Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> HackByteCodex. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
